[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1009","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8174","title":"Microsoft Windows VBScript 引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows VBScript 引擎在处理内存对象时存在越界写入漏洞（CWE-787）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含特制 VBScript 代码的恶意网页，利用内存损坏漏洞在目标系统中执行任意代码。该漏洞广泛影响 Windows 7、Windows 8.1、Windows 10 以及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016 等多个版本，攻击条件为用户需在浏览器中运行受影响的 VBScript 引擎。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8174"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-05-09T19:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:24Z","remediation":"立即安装微软 2018 年 5 月发布的累积安全更新（针对不同系统版本，如 Windows 10 或 Server 2016），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新至最新补丁版本。作为临时缓解措施，建议禁用或限制 Internet Explorer 中 VBScript 的执行权限，或切换至 Edge 浏览器以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103998","https://blog.0patch.com/2018/05/a-single-instruction-micropatch-for.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8174","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44741/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8174","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44741","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8174.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2018-8174.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f7fdc93b8d4d470f2c23e4fffbdda828848b6048/2018/CVE-2018-8174.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9aee4694c57e6f549d7f2ae075baefe98f4ec05f/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8174.json","https://github.com/0x09AL/CVE-2018-8174-msf/blob/d6636e4aa68db1acc440c3229c9c16de6918d06a/CVE-2018-8174.rb","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8174.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2014/CVE-2014-6332.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/4d788f269ad44a501a2252f60eed87a3837ec472/2018/CVE-2