-06-17T01:31:44Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2018 年 5 月安全更新，通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载对应版本累积更新。受影响系统包括 Windows 7、Windows Server 2008/2012/2016、Windows 8.1、Windows 10 及 Windows RT 8.1。如无法立即打补丁，可配置 COM 对象权限限制非管理员调用，或禁用 Microsoft COM 在 Internet Explorer 中的实例化作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104030","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040848","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-0824","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44906/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0824","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44906","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0824.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2018/CVE-2018-0824.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2018-0824/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2018-0824/README_EN.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0824.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0824.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-0824.md","https://github.com/vuldb/cyber_threat_intelligence/blob/6a5017307e035c2b54c7afbe3bd8582497eafa96/campaigns/c/CVE-2018-0824/README.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-0824.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0824.json","https://github.com/codewhitesec/UnmarshalPwn"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo