-10562.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10562.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10561.md","https://github.com/649/Pingpon-Exploit","https://github.com/c0ld1/GPON_RCE","https://github.com/ATpiu/CVE-2018-10562","https://github.com/Choudai/GPON-LOADER","https://github.com/ExiaHan/GPON"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0108","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10561","title":"Dasan GPON家庭路由器认证绕过漏洞","description":"Dasan GPON家庭路由器存在认证绕过漏洞，攻击者只需在需要认证的URL后附加\"?images\"参数（如/menu.html?images/或/GponForm/diag_FORM?images/），即可完全绕过设备认证机制，无需任何凭证即可访问设备管理界面。该漏洞允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者完全控制受影响的GPON家庭路由器，包括修改配置、查看敏感信息、执行任意操作等。CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。受影响的设备包括Dasan GPON系列家庭路由器产品，目前厂商尚未发布官方修复补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10561"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-05-04T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 Dasan GPON 家庭路由器固件至厂商发布的最新版本（如 H640GW V2.0.0.6 及以上、H660GW V2.0.0.7 及以上），该漏洞在 2018 年已有官方补丁。如无法升级，可在路由器管理界面禁用远程管理（WAN 侧访问），并将管理端口限制为仅内网 IP 可访问，同时在防火墙规则中拦截对 80/443 端口的公网访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/107053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44576/","https://www.vpnmentor.com/blog/critical-vulnerability-gpon-router/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-10561","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-10561.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-10561.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-10561.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-10561.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-10561.rules","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2018/CVE-2018-10561.json","https://github.com/KiritoLoveAsuna/Exploits/blob/a7623c4720a5f8bbc9d24e9726397b947b0d0900/CVE-2018-10561/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-10561.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-10561.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-105xx/CVE-2018-10561.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0223","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0223.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-9845","title":"Etherpad Etherpad Lite 管理员权限绕过漏洞","description":"Etherpad Lite 1.6.4 之前版本存在管理员权限绕过漏洞（CWE-178：大小写处理不当）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径大小写差异绕过管理员权限验证，从而获取管理员面板的完全访问权限。攻击者可进一步创建管理员账户、查看或修改所有文档内容、执行系统命令，导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。该漏洞无需任何认证或用户交互，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。官方已在 1.6.4 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-9845"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-29T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:07:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 Etherpad Lite 至 1.6.4 或更高版本（commit ffe24c3），该版本修复了未授权访问 admin 接口的权限绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层添加访问控制规则，限制 /admin 路径仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ether/etherpad-lite/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/ether/etherpad-lite/commit/ffe24c3dd93efc73e0cbf924db9a0cc40be9511b","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9845.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2018/CVE-2018-9845.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e80f5d408ffad16b39381a0b04b1a01a2a54c308/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9845.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-9845.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-9845-3664.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-9845-3666.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Etherpad Lite/CVE-2018-9845.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-9845.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2018/9xxx/CVE-2018-9845.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-9845.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9845.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0223.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0223.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0223.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0079","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1335","title":"Apache Tika-server 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Tika-server 在 1.7 至 1.17 版本中存在命令注入漏洞。该漏洞源于服务器对客户端发送的特定 HTTP 请求头缺乏严格校验，攻击者可以通过构造恶意的请求头，将指令注入到服务器执行的命令行参数中。当 tika-server 部署在面向不可信客户端的公网环境时，远程未经身份验证的攻击者可利用此漏洞在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令，从而导致服务器完全被接管。建议升级至 Tika 1.18 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1335"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-25T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:51:02Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Apache Tika 升级到 1.18 或更高版本。如果无法立即升级，应通过防火墙限制 tika-server 的访问权限，确保其不对不受信任的外部客户端开放，以防止远程命令注入攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153864/Apache-Tika-1.17-Header-Command-Injection.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104001","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:3140","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/b3ed4432380af767effd4c6f27665cc7b2686acccbefeb9f55851dca%40%3Cdev.tika.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46540/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46540","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1335.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-1335.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/976754950fcf68c46d91206b7029022222e8684c/2018/CVE-2018-1335.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/8b4078d62a74c93dc4c23d215ab5f6afbd5639cd/2018/CVE-2018-1335.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-1335.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1335-3276.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1335-3273.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1335-3275.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1335-3277.yaml","https://github.com/RhinoSecurityLabs/CVEs/blob/0542b712a86502541a2499e588796704f30a0e5f/CVE-2018-1335/CVE-2018-1335.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Tika/CVE-2018-1335.yaml","https://github.com/SkyBlueEternal/CVE-2018-1335-EXP-GUI","https://github.com/canumay/cve-2018-1335","https://github.com/DigitalNinja00/CVE-2018-1335","https://github.com/siramk/CVE-2018-1335","https://github.com/N0b1e6/CVE-2018-1335-Python3"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0079.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0079.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0038","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10245","title":"AWStats 全路径泄露信息泄露漏洞","description":"AWStats 7.6 及之前版本存在一个全路径泄露（Full Path Disclosure）漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理请求时未能正确过滤输入，远程攻击者可通过向 `awstats.pl` 脚本发送精心构造的 `framename` 和 `update` 等参数，触发服务器返回包含配置文件绝对路径的错误信息。这使得攻击者能够获取服务器内部的文件系统结构，为进一步的攻击（如敏感文件读取）提供关键线索。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10245"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-20T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:45Z","remediation":"建议将 AWStats 升级到 7.7 或更高版本，以修复全路径泄露漏洞。如果无法立即升级，可通过在 Web 服务器配置中限制对 awstats.pl 脚本的访问权限，或在 WAF 中拦截包含敏感参数（如 framename）的请求来缓解此风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/theyiyibest/AWStatsFullPathDisclosure","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10245.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10245.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10245.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-10245.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/vex/cve/2018/CVE-2018-10245.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-10245.rules","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/osv/cve/2018/UBUNTU-CVE-2018-10245.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-10245.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10245.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-10245.yaml","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/active/CVE-2018-10245"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0036","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10201","title":"NComputing vSpace Pro NC Monitor Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"NComputing vSpace Pro 10 和 11 版本的 NC Monitor Server (NcMonitorServer.exe) 存在目录遍历漏洞。由于服务端未能对用户请求的路径参数进行有效校验，远程未经身份验证的攻击者可以通过向 TCP 8667 端口发送包含 \"../\" 或 \"..\\\" 等遍历序列的特制 URL 请求，绕过 Web 根目录限制，从而读取服务器上的任意敏感文件。该漏洞会导致机密信息泄露，影响 vSpace Pro 10 及 11 系列产品的安全性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10201"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-20T08:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:40Z","remediation":"立即更新 NComputing vSpace Pro 至最新安全版本以修复路径过滤缺陷。若无法立即升级，建议在防火墙层面严格限制 TCP 8667 端口的外部访问，仅允许授权的内部管理 IP 访问，以防止远程攻击者利用目录遍历漏洞读取敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kwell.net/kwell_blog/?p=5199","https://support.ncomputing.com/portal/kb/articles/ncomputing-health-monitor-server-vulnerability-patch","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44497/","https://www.kwell.net/kwell/index.php?option=com_newsfeeds&view=newsfeed&id=15&Itemid=173&lang=es","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44497","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10201.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10201.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10201.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-10201.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10201-3166.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10201-3167.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-10201.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/NComputing vSpace Pro/CVE-2018-10201.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10201.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10201.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/ncomputing/vspace_pro/CVE-2018-10201.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0037","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10230","title":"Zend Zend Server Zend Debugger 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Zend Server 9.1.3 之前的版本中，Zend Debugger 模块存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞由于未能对用户输入的数据进行充分的过滤和转义，导致攻击者可以通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的特制请求，诱导受害者访问该链接，从而在受害者的浏览器上下文中执行任意代码。攻击者可利用此漏洞窃取敏感 Cookie、劫持用户会话或进行其他钓鱼攻击。此漏洞影响 Zend Server 9.1.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分为 6.1。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10230"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-19T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:43Z","remediation":"建议将 Zend Server 升级至 9.1.3 或更高版本以修复 Zend Debugger 中的 XSS 漏洞。若无法立即升级，建议通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）过滤包含恶意脚本标签的输入请求，或限制 Zend Debugger 的访问权限仅允许信任的 IP 地址访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.synacktiv.com/ressources/zend_server_9_1_3_xss.pdf","https://www.zend.com/en/products/server/release-notes","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10230.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10230.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10230.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-10230.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-10230.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10230.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/zend/zend_server/CVE-2018-10230.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10230.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-10230.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-10230/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-10230.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2018-10230.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0173","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-2791","title":"Oracle WebCenter Sites Advanced UI 访问控制漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 Oracle WebCenter Sites 组件 Advanced UI 子组件存在访问控制漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 利用该漏洞，在需要受害者交互的情况下，成功利用后可导致未授权访问关键数据或完全访问所有 Oracle WebCenter Sites 可访问数据，并可对部分数据进行未授权的更新、插入或删除操作。该漏洞影响 11.1.1.8.0、12.2.1.2.0 及 12.2.1.3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2018-2791"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-19T02:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:56:20Z","remediation":"请登录 My Oracle Support 下载并安装 Oracle 2018 年 4 月关键补丁更新（Critical Patch Update）中针对 Oracle WebCenter Sites 的安全补丁。受影响版本包括 11.1.1.8.0、12.2.1.2.0 和 12.2.1.3.0，对应补丁可通过 Oracle Fusion Middleware 的补丁文档获取（MOS 文档 2353306.1）。如无法立即打补丁，建议在网络层面限制对 WebCenter Sites Advanced UI 组件的访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuapr2018-3678067.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103800","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040695","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44752/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44752","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2791.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-2791.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2791.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-2791.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-2791-3520.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-2791-3521.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-2791-3517.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-2791-3516.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-2791-3522.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-2791.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medium/CVE-2018-2791.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0173.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0706","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-2628","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server WLS核心组件反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server WLS核心组件存在反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过T3协议向目标服务器发送精心构造的序列化Java对象，触发不安全的反序列化操作，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响WebLogic Server 10.3.6.0、12.1.3.0、12.2.1.2及12.2.1.3版本，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可利用，成功利用可完全控制目标服务器。Oracle已在2018年4月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-2628"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-19T02:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:55:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle WebLogic Server 至 2018 年 4 月关键补丁更新（CPU）对应版本：10.3.6.0 升级至 10.3.6.0.180417，12.1.3.0 升级至 12.1.3.0.180417，12.2.1.2 升级至 12.2.1.2.180417，12.2.1.3 升级至 12.2.1.3.180417。如无法立即升级，可在 WebLogic 控制台中将 T3 协议访问限制为仅受信任 IP 段，或在网络防火墙/安全组中封禁 T3 默认端口 7001 的入站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuapr2018-3678067.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103776","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040696","https://github.com/brianwrf/CVE-2018-2628","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44553/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45193/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46513/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-2628","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45193","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2628.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-2628.md","https://github.com/k8gege/K8tools/blob/5aca0cef8bba0f00a001eb1f4f71b380205c4b8d/CVE-2018-2628 Weblogic GetShell.py","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-2628.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2018-2628_poc.py","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2018-2628_webshell.py","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2018-2628.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/CMS-Hunter/blob/5ad0da9524b385045e7a4a627d2bb52906badfc5/WebLogic/CVE-2018-2628/README.md","https://github.com/ym2011/POC-EXP/blob/206b22d3a6b2a172359678df33bbc5b2ad04b6c3/CVE-2018-2628/CVE-2018-2628-README.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/CMS-Hunter/blob/5ad0da9524b385045e7a4a627d2bb52906badfc5/WebLogic/CVE-2018-2628/poc.py","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/漏洞复现Weblogic_反序列化命令执行漏洞_(CVE-2018-2628).md","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/tdy218/ysoserial-cve-2018-2628","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2018-2628","https://github.com/shengqi158/CVE-2018-2628","https://github.com/forlin/CVE-2018-2628"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0808","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-5430","title":"TIBCO JasperReports Server Spring Web Flow 路径遍历信息泄露漏洞","description":"TIBCO JasperReports Server 等产品的 Spring Web Flow 组件存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），已通过身份认证的攻击者可构造恶意请求遍历目录并读取 Web 应用关键配置文件（如数据库连接字符串、加密密钥、管理员凭证等），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 TIBCO JasperReports Server 6.4.2 及之前版本、JasperReports Server Community Edition 6.4.2 及之前版本、JasperReports Server for ActiveMatrix BPM、Jaspersoft for AWS 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。攻击者只需拥有有效账户即可利用，无需额外权限，ExploitDB 上已有公开利用代码。TIBCO 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-5430"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-04-17T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:00:17Z","remediation":"建议按照以下对应关系升级修复：JasperReports Server 6.2.4 及更早版本升级至 6.2.5 或更高；6.3.0/6.3.2/6.3.3 版本升级至 6.3.4 或更高；6.4.0/6.4.2 版本升级至 6.4.3 或更高。社区版、ActiveMatrix BPM 版及所有 AWS 版本（含 Multi-Tenancy 和 Reporting and Analytics）均升级至 6.4.3 或更高。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层对 /flow.html 的 page 参数实施白名单校验，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历序列，并限制低权限用户对 WEB-INF 目录及配置文件的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://rhinosecuritylabs.com/application-security/authenticated-file-read-vulnerability-in-jasperreports/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44623/","https://www.tibco.com/support/advisories/2018/04/tibco-security-advisory-april-17-2018-tibco-jasperreports-2018-5430","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-5430","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44623","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-5430.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2018/5xxx/CVE-2018-5430.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f625935bbdd0ae4ac139d59ec61616511fa07861/2018/5xxx/CVE-2018-5430.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-5430.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-5430.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2018/CVE-2018-5430.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/c