2018-9118.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-9118.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-9118-3651.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-9118-3653.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-9118-3654.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-9118.yaml","https://github.com/Akokonunes/Private-Nuclei-Templates/blob/f92d2274458a958ed01345915693cf1dbe026f83/CVE-2018-9118","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ca27d016571e65b8b794044c0722f4842d8c02cb/cves/2018/9xxx/CVE-2018-9118.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0218.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0198","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1273","title":"Spring Data Commons 远程代码执行漏洞 漏洞","description":"Spring Data Commons 是 Spring Data 的基础模块，提供了统一的 Repository 和数据操作抽象。该漏洞源于 Spring Data Commons 在处理属性绑定时对特殊字符的过滤不当（CWE-94 代码注入）。攻击者无需身份认证，只需向 Spring Data REST 构建的 HTTP 资源接口，或通过 Spring Data 的投影机制发送投影式请求参数，即可注入恶意表达式或代码，最终在服务器端执行任意命令，导致远程代码执行（RCE）。受影响版本包括 1.13 系列（<1.13.10）、2.0 系列（<2.0.5）及旧的不受支持版本。攻击条件极低：仅需网络访问，无需用户交互。该漏洞可被用于完全控制目标服务器，危及业务系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1273"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-11T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-26T18:44:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Spring Data Commons 到 1.13.10（1.13.x 版本线）或 2.0.5（2.0.x 版本线）及更高版本；若通过 Spring Boot 管理依赖，请升级 Spring Boot 至 1.5.13（对应 1.13.x）或 2.0.5（对应 2.0.x）。同时升级 Spring Data REST 到 2.5.11、2.6.11 或 3.0.6 及以上版本。若 Spring Data REST 面向公网暴露且非业务必需，应尽快下线或通过网关/WAF 进行访问控制与参数过滤。对于使用 projection 绑定的自定义接口，务必移除或加强服务端输入校验，限制请求参数中的 SpEL 表达式注入。如暂无法升级，可在应用层拦截器中对所有请求参数进行白名单过滤，拒绝包含特殊字符（如括号、大括号、$、#、反引号等）的输入，并监控日志中是否存在异常的类型转换错误。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/ignite-dev/201807.mbox/%3CCAK0qHnqzfzmCDFFi6c5Jok19zNkVCz5Xb4sU%3D0f2J_1i4p46zQ%40mail.gmail.com%3E","https://pivotal.io/security/cve-2018-1273","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2022.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-1273","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44952","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1273.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-1273.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/spring/cve-2018-1273_cmd.py","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2018-1273/CVE-2018-1273.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5ffa820afafb07e3d2a3856e2c3d1b6e11ccbbaa/2018/CVE-2018-1273.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/1d6e950db7856d287e41f25ab3160793b53fc99d/2018/CVE-2018-1273.json","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/spring/CVE-2018-1273.md","https://github.com/BaizeSec/bylibrary/blob/dee1fbaa831df860c6905f80de8700211ba63098/docs/漏洞库/06-中间件框架漏洞/Spring/cve-2018-1273_cmd.md","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perscheme/poc_srping_cve-2018-1273_2018.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/framework/Spring-Data-Commons-远程命令执行漏洞-CVE-2018-1273.md","https://github.com/PortSwigger/BChecks/blob/7117c5ff8d1d47ca6282020a243b4d3026480ad5/vulnerabilities-CVEd/CVE-2018-1273-spring_data_commons_rce.bcheck","https://github.com/AabyssZG/SpringBoot-Scan","https://github.com/WuliRuler/SBSCAN","https://github.com/jas502n/cve-2018-1273","https://github.com/wearearima/poc-cve-2018-1273","https://github.com/knqyf263/CVE-2018-1273"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0198.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0198.toml"}]